ai "Possession Receiver"
about "Sure hands over the middle; moves the chains and gets down or out."
position WR
dials vision 0.55 discipline 0.9 patience 0.7 aggression 0.3 risk 0.2

rules:
  when before the throw and route done -> settle in the gap
  when ball thrown to me -> secure the catch
  when with the ball and past the sticks and sideline within 3 -> get out of bounds
  when with the ball and enemy within 1.2 -> protect the ball; lower shoulder
  when with the ball -> run to daylight
  when mate has the ball -> block downfield
  otherwise -> follow assignment
